# Flutter Flame Game Rules

- Use `@override` when extending `FlameGame` or `Component`
- Use `images.load()` or `loadSprite()` for sprites/assets
- Prefer `HitboxRectangle` or `HitboxCircle` for collision
- Use `HasGameReference<KafaTopuGame>` (HasGameRef is deprecated)
- For Vector2 to Offset: `Offset(size.x/2, size.y/2)`
